
** Simple soil file for European marginal sites
**

SOLNAM = 'EC1-coarse'

** physical properties
SMW      =   0.040  !  soil moisture content at wilting point [cm3/cm3]
SMFCF    =   0.110  !  soil moisture content at field capacity [cm3/cm3]
SM0      =   0.390  !  soil moisture content at saturation [cm3/cm3]
CRAIRC   =   0.090  ! critical soil air content for aeration [cm3/cm3]

** soil hydraulic properties
K0       =  99.770  ! hydraulic conductivity of saturated soil [cm day-1]
SOPE     =  12.47   ! maximum percolation rate root zone[cm day-1]
KSUB     =  24.03   ! maximum percolation rate subsoil [cm day-1]

** soil depth
RDMSOL = 35.0 ! maximum rooting depth [cm]
